Credits & Inspiration

FixupXer builds upon ideas from these excellent projects:

- ClearURLs (https://github.com/ClearURLs/Addon) - Tracking parameter database
- Léon - The URL Cleaner by Sven Jacobs (https://github.com/leon-cleaning-services/leon, formerly svenjacobs/leon) - GPL-3.0-or-later; Android URL-cleaning concept; selected cleaner behaviour independently adapted without copying code or rule data (see docs/THIRD_PARTY_PROVENANCE.md)
- Untracker (https://github.com/zhanghai/Untracker) - Apache-2.0; URL-cleaning scope inspiration, no code or rules imported
- FxEmbed (https://github.com/FxEmbed/FxEmbed) - Twitter embed improvements
- fxbsky.app / FxEmbed (https://github.com/FxEmbed/FxEmbed) - Bluesky embed link service
- InstaFix (https://github.com/Wikidepia/InstaFix) - Instagram embed enhancements

Special thanks to the maintainers of facebookez.com, toinstagram.com, adamlikes.men and instagram7.com for their link enhancement services. (FixupXer also still recognises the earlier proxies kkinstagram.com and eeinstagram.com so legacy URLs continue to work.)

